e": "2560 1440.png", "id": "1077341404090196", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540508_1077341407423529_4511965539534469614_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uacaBQxEZREQ7kNvwG-KWRD&_nc_oc=AdrqEjzIgV3wb_yVZMSZ5eNepJ1AMc-zf80S7H0BhUIDCz2266tandKmMqVI94W34zY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQqRvQGfJpe5kuxiA22ywoikWrWjFlPiZCLRGjwe4P17g&oe=6AFDBA8B"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2QqZr7ouCRAQ7kNvwFx989B&_nc_oc=AdqEYJtyvpMfkMB2OYDoiY0V4cwpi9skRA5qMt_khZw7Ih1kItagwoq6OwHMHI6KxxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSfiKC7R8c5ICYdB88iyCPIY0mE963Vyl8kZrqM1isZ_g&oe=6AFDAE09"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc